        "title": "The plans below show how the ground floor of a particular building has changed over time. Summarize the information by selecting and reporting the main features.",
        "status": "published",
        "content_writing": "<div data-page-id=\"WC9GdWptxodM3rxqUu4lYwk6gDd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Sr3gdwtPEoeiv0xQVyblFbQMgW7\"><em><strong>The plans below show how the ground floor of a particular building has changed over time. Summarize the information by selecting and reporting the main features.</strong></em></div>\n</div>",
        "order": 1,
        "instruction": "<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\">HƯỚNG DẪN VIẾT B&Agrave;I</h2>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><em>IELTS Writing Task 1 - Ground floor changes over three periods</em></p>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-N0nNdqrxtoU9EGxkGvml6QHzgzd\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GWPNd7ft0oPRpuxfDGnl1aKWgoe\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QxWPdDnfdod2NixZJAjlLYzqgGb\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>1.</strong><strong> Giải th&iacute;ch đề</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QxWPdDnfdod2NixZJAjlLYzqgGb\">Đề b&agrave;i <em>Ground floor changes over three periods</em> y&ecirc;u cầu m&ocirc; tả về bố cục tầng trệt của một t&ograve;a nh&agrave; qua 3 giai đoạn thời gian:</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QxWPdDnfdod2NixZJAjlLYzqgGb\">\n<ul>\n<li>1958-1984: Office</li>\n<li>1985-2000: Apartment</li>\n<li>2001-Present: Flower Shop</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QxWPdDnfdod2NixZJAjlLYzqgGb\">&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TTLqda2f9ooxOTxsgKLlEoHXgHc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>2.</strong><strong> Định hướng viết Introduction</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-J4uYdJ7WaomtjrxzeNDl41h0g1n\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DQntd3hjzoNCjwxOfz4lvHOcgbb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-N9LhdhEVXoJnGNxJPvyl0YZPg9e\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CRT6dLvfRoVbHtxCnc9l7AdygTl\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\" old-record-id-KGfkdvXnMo9tBVxWubvlf0gagVh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TOoQd6oJTo25Hhxi84tlE4FPgnb\"><strong>Nội dung:</strong> Paraphrase đề <em>Ground floor changes over three periods</em> với c&aacute;c dữ kiện ch&iacute;nh l&agrave;: sự thay đổi bố cục tầng trệt của một t&ograve;a nh&agrave; - qua 3 giai đoạn: 1958-1984, 1985-2000, 2001-đến hiện tại.</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-J4uYdJ7WaomtjrxzeNDl41h0g1n\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>3.</strong><strong> Định hướng viết Overview</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M2Q9ds2Mgoz0ICx8JzslKUMJgWf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WTQ0dwsgtot3Mux4ZXOl05hSgTH\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-AmqcddMWAotWQFxJT6xl8CElghf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RKcrd7u17ogCsex6cUPlJ2cCgkh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JLrudDKQVoB78vxXmgzldmNBgLh\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-U7iadbsa0o9CMOxYDBClUkAhgse\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, với dạng đề map, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ tập trung n&oacute;i về c&aacute;c sự thay đổi ch&iacute;nh:</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-AZYodOsfSod6E5xJw0Flch6wgZd\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>c&oacute; một số thay đổi đ&aacute;ng kể tại t&ograve;a nh&agrave; về mục đ&iacute;ch sử dụng: Từ Office &rarr; Apartment &rarr; Flower shop</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-XS6XduQ67oL350xRUvOlsoiKgob\" data-list=\"bullet\">đ&aacute;ng ch&uacute; &yacute; l&agrave; Kichen v&agrave; Entrance vẫn giữ nguy&ecirc;n vị tr&iacute; xuy&ecirc;n suốt cả 3 giai đoạn</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JLrudDKQVoB78vxXmgzldmNBgLh\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JLrudDKQVoB78vxXmgzldmNBgLh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M2Q9ds2Mgoz0ICx8JzslKUMJgWf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>4.</strong><strong> Ph&acirc;n chia BODY r&otilde; r&agrave;ng</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RIbUdfSlNoloclxlVrOltQUhg8e\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-P98ZdcS4KoF2cIxRdnYl02e4gre\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FVyzdmf9noY8HEx1DxAl475ZgPh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZRV0dgAnjoXiRVxRxmol5UwwgBb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PlnOdHjiuoEse4xeDDrlsghVgug\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ chia đoạn th&acirc;n b&agrave;i theo tr&igrave;nh tự thời gian, gom c&aacute;c thay đổi của từng giai đoạn chuyển đổi:</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PlnOdHjiuoEse4xeDDrlsghVgug\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PlnOdHjiuoEse4xeDDrlsghVgug\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CpWhdSGJFoye2PxbbFelCRADg5e\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<h4 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FKLxd8T0jomlW3xlEQ5lfJGxgwb\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>BODY 1:</strong><strong> Giai đoạn 1958-1984 v&agrave; 1985-2000</strong></span></h4>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Xz8Sd3833oJVsmxgnsUlprJUgUb\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ định hướng c&aacute;c bạn viết từng bước ở BODY 1 như sau:</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Vw50dZaq3oF2ZIxm3TBlq500gRe\">(Step 1) <strong>M&ocirc; tả bố cục t&ograve;a nh&agrave; trong giai đoạn 1958-1984:</strong></div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JUA4dxEvgohR9ZxnhsblIGlIgJf\" data-list=\"bullet\">Ph&iacute;a tr&ecirc;n: c&oacute; một <em>ph&ograve;ng họp (meeting room) </em>ở g&oacute;c tr&aacute;i v&agrave; <em>bếp (kitchen)</em> ở g&oacute;c phải</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PcKbdkvyNoYKcfxcLnflaBuogPh\" data-list=\"bullet\">Ph&iacute;a b&ecirc;n tr&aacute;i v&agrave; phải: ph&iacute;a b&ecirc;n tr&aacute;i c&oacute;&nbsp;<em>văn ph&ograve;ng trợ l&yacute; (assistant's office)</em> v&agrave; <em>văn ph&ograve;ng thư k&yacute; (secretary's office)</em>, trong khi b&ecirc;n phải c&oacute; một <em>văn ph&ograve;ng quản l&yacute; (manager's office)</em></li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PcKbdkvyNoYKcfxcLnflaBuogPh\" data-list=\"bullet\">Ph&iacute;a dưới: c&oacute; <em>nh&agrave; vệ sinh (toilet)</em> ở g&oacute;c tr&aacute;i b&ecirc;n dưới v&agrave; <em>khu vực tiếp t&acirc;n (reception area) gần (adjacent)</em> <em>lối v&agrave;o (entrance)</em></li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MlX8dHCreoaAIXx2VHXlgT9ugNh\">(Step 2) <strong>M&ocirc; tả bố cục t&ograve;a nh&agrave; trong giai đoạn 1985-2000</strong>:</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-D5hBdcWaxoptvfxYWxgl49IDgzd\" data-list=\"bullet\"><em>Khu vực ph&ograve;ng họp v&agrave; c&aacute;c văn ph&ograve;ng (work spaces)</em> ph&iacute;a tr&ecirc;n b&ecirc;n tr&aacute;i biến th&agrave;nh một <em>ph&ograve;ng kh&aacute;ch rộng (spacious living room)</em>, c&ograve;n bếp (kitchen) vẫn giữ nguy&ecirc;n vị tr&iacute;.</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QAqbdgf1XoxA29xoXCMlDEHgg6A\" data-list=\"bullet\"><em>C&aacute;c</em> <em>văn ph&ograve;ng (office spaces)</em> ph&iacute;a dưới b&ecirc;n tr&aacute;i&nbsp;<em>được thay thế bằng</em> (were replaced by) <em>ph&ograve;ng tắm (bathroom with shower facilities)</em>, v&agrave; <em>2 ph&ograve;ng ngủ (two bedrooms)</em> cũng được x&acirc;y th&ecirc;m ph&iacute;a b&ecirc;n phải.</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<br>\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<h4 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-P28wdkqCxoxJzCxhGfIlLa1cgwd\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;\">&nbsp;BODY</span><strong>&nbsp;2:</strong><strong> Giai đoạn 2001-Present</strong></span></h4>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PlnOdHjiuoEse4xeDDrlsghVgug\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-EwzTddSWRoqDSGxM4hFlvPg1grc\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OrA9dgGjNoRCVUxfgJ1lOWFlglh\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ định hướng c&aacute;c bạn viết từng bước ở BODY 2 như sau:</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IkHudzeJ4oBsktxrxaeld0Dcgvb\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">(Step 1)<strong> M&ocirc; tả sự thay đổi ở khu vực ph&iacute;a tr&ecirc;n v&agrave; b&ecirc;n tr&aacute;i:</strong></div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-P4tHdz1hUolSqWxwKZrl2KT7g8t\" data-list=\"bullet\"><em>Ph&ograve;ng kh&aacute;ch (living rooma area)</em>&nbsp;<em>được chuyển đổi th&agrave;nh (was transformed into)</em> <em>khu vực b&aacute;n thiệp (gift cards section)</em> v&agrave; <em>khu trưng b&agrave;y hoa (large flower display area)</em></li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DpUedAbEIotdF1x6VAClL5NNgXb\" data-list=\"bullet\"><em>Bếp (kitchen)</em> vẫn <em>giữ nguy&ecirc;n vị tr&iacute; ở g&oacute;c tr&ecirc;n b&ecirc;n phải (continued to occupy its original location)</em></li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-NtzkdMhGco10OhxizWKlFrxEgSb\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">(Step 2) <strong>M&ocirc; tả sự thay đổi ở khu vực ph&iacute;a dưới v&agrave; b&ecirc;n phải:</strong></div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QTPed1g1hoylwox5mXFltXnvgQf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-list=\"bullet\"><em>Ph&ograve;ng tắm (bathroom)</em> <em>được thay thế bằng (was replaced by)</em> <em>khu vui chơi trẻ em (children's play area)</em></li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-SJnfdN6cAojMiJxcqNElQWGqgId\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-list=\"bullet\">C&aacute;c <em>ph&ograve;ng ngủ (bedrooms)</em>&nbsp;<em>nhường chỗ cho (gave way to)</em> một <em>văn ph&ograve;ng (office) </em>v&agrave; <em>khu trưng b&agrave;y hoa kh&aacute;c (another flower section)</em></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
        "writing_logical_frame": [
          {
            "id": 2860,
            "sort": 1,
            "name": "Introduction",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"WC9GdWptxodM3rxqUu4lYwk6gDd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-URTldypHIouaxbxtpqflk11lgrf\">The plans illustrate how the ground floor layout of a building was altered over three distinct periods: 1958-1984, 1985-2000, and 2001 to the present day.</div>\n</div>",
            "question_id": 37171,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 2861,
            "sort": 2,
            "name": "Overview",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"WC9GdWptxodM3rxqUu4lYwk6gDd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WfQTdmaoEoVPpsx28salngNBgpe\">Overall, the building underwent significant transformations, changing from an office to an apartment, and finally to a flower shop. Notably, the kitchen and entrance remained in their original positions throughout all three periods.</div>\n</div>",
            "question_id": 37171,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 2862,
            "sort": 3,
            "name": "Body 1",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"WC9GdWptxodM3rxqUu4lYwk6gDd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-A25hdCU8Uo0Tfkx1voRlKforg6c\">In the first period, the building functioned as an office, with a meeting room and kitchen occupying the upper section. The left side housed the assistant's and secretary's offices, while a larger manager's office was situated on the right. At the bottom, there was a toilet on the left and a reception area adjacent to the entrance. When the building was converted into an apartment between 1985 and 2000, these work spaces were completely redesigned. The upper left area became a spacious living room, while the kitchen retained its position. The former office spaces on the left were replaced by a bathroom with shower facilities, and two bedrooms were added on the right side.</div>\n</div>",
            "question_id": 37171,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 2863,
            "sort": 4,
            "name": "Body 2",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"WC9GdWptxodM3rxqUu4lYwk6gDd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OaUudidLSoiJlTxZEUslb5kkgjh\">From 2001 onwards, the apartment was transformed into a flower shop. The living room area was converted into a gift cards section and a large flower display area. The bathroom was replaced by a children's play area, while the bedrooms gave way to an office and another flower section. The kitchen, however, continued to occupy its original location in the upper right corner.</div>\n</div>",
            "question_id": 37171,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          }
        ],
